1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,250
Wag your fingers like wipers.

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:03,180
Same way...

3
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,600
now FASTER!

4
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:06,370
Flipped into a mirror?

5
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:07,080
Your hands are

6
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:09,133
clingy TWINS.

7
00:00:09,157 --> 00:00:10,190
Slow down.

8
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:11,778
One swings IN,

9
00:00:11,778 --> 00:00:13,000
the other OUT...

10
00:00:13,030 --> 00:00:14,833
your brain's refereeing.

11
00:00:14,860 --> 00:00:15,703
Faster?

12
00:00:15,703 --> 00:00:16,900
The ref gives up...

13
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,110
and the twins

14
00:00:18,110 --> 00:00:19,167
COPY.

15
00:00:19,194 --> 00:00:21,511
Two PEOPLE swinging their legs

16
00:00:21,511 --> 00:00:22,767
side by side?

17
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:24,233
They flip too!

18
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:26,540
Now try to flip it BACK.

